<title>JAPAN: Dynic to issue 60 mln SFR warrant.</title>
<headline>Dynic to issue 60 mln SFR warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Dynic Corp</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Daiwa Securities Bank (Switzerland)</p>
<p>GUARANTOR - Sakura Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	   ISSUE NO		AMT   60 million SFR</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE PAR	 MATURITY 19.Sep.00</p>
<p> EXER PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> EXER FROM 3.Oct.96   EXER TO 12.Sep.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 19.Sep.96  INT PAY 19.Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 10.Sep.96 SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon, conversion price and currency rate will be decided on September 110.</p>
</text>
